$DATUM Diphenyl(trimethylsilylamino)(trimethylsilylimino)-phosphorane, 2c. This
compound was synthesized using a literature procedure.11 Ph2PH (3.00 mL,
17.2 mmol, d = 1.07) and N3SiMe3 (5.00 mL, 35.8 mmol, d = 0.868, 95%)
were refluxed overnight in a round-bottom flask with a reflux condenser
under a positive pressure of nitrogen. After 12 h the reflux was stopped
and the product was distilled through a short path distillation apparatus
(0.01 mm, 129 °C) to yield a clear liquid (5.28 g, 85%). Spectral data
agreed with literature values. clear liquid.1HNMR (C6D6): δ 7-7.75 (br m,
C6 H 5, 10H), 1.88 (br s, NH, 1H), 0.34 (s, SiCH 3, 9H), 0.18 (s, SiCH 3,
9H). 31P{1H}NMR (C6D6): δ 0.06 (s).
