$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Synthesis of Ph2FluP=NMes (2c). A degassed solution of MesN3 (1.00 g,
6.20 mmol) in toluene (5 mL) was added at room temperature to a degassed
suspension of Ph2PFlu (2.15 g, 6.15 mmol) in toluene (50 mL). After the
mixture was stirred for 24 h at room temperature, the solvent was
eliminated under vacuum to yield a pale yellow solid. Cooling a solution
of 2c in toluene/pentane to -25 °C yielded 2.50 g of pale yellow crystals
(84%). 31P{1H} NMR (81 MHz, C6D6): δppm -1.7 (s). 1H NMR (300 MHz, C6D6):
δppm 7.65 (d, 3JH,H = 7.8 Hz, 2H, H3,3'), 7.44 (m, 4H, H13), 7.37 (d,
3JH,H = 7.5 Hz, 2H, H6,6'), 7.14 (m, 2H, H5,5'), 7.03 (m, 2H, H4,4'),
6.95 (m, 2H, H15), 6.90 (m, 4H, H14), 6.85 (m, 2H, H10), 5.12 (d, 2JH,P =
24.0 Hz, 1H, H1), 2.35 (d, 5JH,H = 1.5 Hz, 6H, o-CH3), 2.25 (d, 7JH,H =
2.4 Hz, 3H, p-CH3). 13C{1H} NMR (75.5 MHz, C6D6): δppm 145.4 (C8), 142.2
(d, 2JC,P = 4.5 Hz, C7,7'), 140.2 (d, 3JC,P = 3.8 Hz, C2,2'), 131.9 (d,
2JC,P = 8.3 Hz, C13), 131.6 (d, 3JC,P = 6.8 Hz, C9,9'), 130.8 (d, 4JC,P =
3.0 Hz, C15), 129.9 (C11), 129.2 (d, 1JC,P = 92.1 Hz, C12), 128.7 (d,
4JC,P = 2.3 Hz, C10), 127.5 (d, 3JC,P=10.6 Hz, C14), 127.2 (d, 5JC,P =
2.3 Hz, C5,5'), 126.8 (d, 3JC,P = 3.0 Hz, C3,3'), 126.3 (d, 4JC,P = 2.3
Hz, C4,4'), 119.5 (d, 4JC,P = 1.5 Hz, C6,6'), 53.0 (d, 1JC,P = 65.7 Hz,
C1), 21.6 (d, 4JC,P = 1.5 Hz, o-CH3), 20.5 (d, 6JC,P = 0.8 Hz, p-CH3). MS
(EI 70 eV) m/z: 483 (M)+, 318 (M - Flu)+, 240 (M - Flu - Ph)+, 165
(Flu)+. Anal. Calcd foror C34H30NP: C, 84.45; H, 6.25; N, 2.90. Found: C,
84.21; H, 6.26; N, 2.82. Mp 182 °C.
