$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: General procedure for the
Staudinger/aza-Wittig reaction: Triphenylphosphine (157 mg, 0.6 mmol) was
added under nitrogen to a solution of the corresponding Ugi adduct 5a-y
(0.4 mmol) in toluene (10 ml) and the mixture was stirred for 24 h at
room temperature. Then the solvent was evaporated under reduced pressure
and the residue was purified by column chromatography (hexane/AcOEt
mixtures as eluent). Spectral assignations in NMR were performed from
DEPT, COSY, HMQC and HMBC experiments on 6a and DEPT experiment on 6c,
both in CDCl3, as model compounds.
N-Cyclohexyl-2-(4-fluorophenyl)-4-(4-methylbenzyl)-5-oxo-3,4-dihydrobenzo[e][1,4]diazepine-3-carboxamide
6f, (158 mg, 83%), colorless crystals (hexane/AcOEt),. mp 188-189 °C, 1H
NMR (400MHz, CDCl3) δ 7.96 (dd, J = 1.2 Hz, J = 7.9 Hz, 1H, HAr),
7.72-7.69 (m, 2H, HAr), 7.50-7.46 (m, 1H, HAr), 7.34-7.24 (m, 2H, HAr),
7.20 (d, J = 7.9 Hz, 2H, HAr) 7.05-7.00 (m, 4H, HAr), 5.20 (s, 1H), 5.13
(d, J = 8.4 Hz, 1H), 5.00 (d, J = 14.2 Hz, 1H), 4.61 (d, J = 14.2 Hz,
1H), 3.22-3.15 (m, 1H), 2.25 (s, 3H), 1.44-0.93 (m, 8H), 0.61-0.40 ( m,
2H); 13C NMR (100MHz, CDCl3) δ 167.5 (Cq), 164.7 (Cq), 164.6 (d, 1J =
252.5 Hz, CHAr), 163.8 (Cq), 146.3 (Cq), 138.8 (Cq), 134.4 (d, 4J = 3.1
Hz, Cq), 133.5 (CHAr), 132.4 (CHAr), 130.8 (CHAr), 130.1(CHAr), 130.1 (d,
3J = 8.9 Hz, CHAr), 129.2 (CHAr), 127.3 (CHAr), 126.5 (CHAr), 126.0 (Cq),
115.8 (d, 2J = 21.9 Hz, CHAr), 59.2 (CH), 52.6 (CH2), 48.2 (CH), 32.5
(CH2), 32.3 (CH2), 25.4 (CH2), 24.8 (CH2), 24.6 (CH2), 21.3 (CH3); IR
(KBr) ν̃ 3313 (NH), 3041 (CHAr), 2932, 2844, 1673 (C=O), 1521; EIMS m/z
483 (M+, 11), 359 (21), 358 (84), 277 (20), 254 (15), 253 (95), 226 (16),
225 (19), 197 (29), 105 (100); HRMS (EI) calcd for C30H30N3O2F: 483.2322;
found 483.2318; Anal. Calcd for C30H30N3O2F: C, 74.51; H, 6.25; N, 8.69.
Found: C, 74.62; H, 6.32; N, 8.78. Crystal data for 6f, C30H30N3O2F, M =
356.42, triclinic, P-1, a = 7.335(3) Å, b = 12.541(5) Å, c = 14.091(5) Å,
α = 91.456(6)°, β = 90.034(6)°, γ = 103.156(6)°; V = 1261.8(8) Å3, Z = 2,
Dcalc = 1.270 gcm-1, μ(Mo-Kα) = 0.085 mm-1. Colorless prism, (0.30 x 0.30
x 0.25) mm3. 9463 measured reflections, 3990 independent (Rint = 0.0641),
3415 observed (I > 2σ(I)). R1 = 0.1964, wR2 = 0.4563 (all data). CCDC
710906.
