$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Synthesis of Ph2FluP=N(i-Pr2)2C6H3 (2b). A degassed solution of
2,6-i-Pr2C6H3N3 (0.60 g, 3.10 mmol) in toluene (8 mL) was added at room
temperature to a degassed suspension of Ph2PFlu (1.00 g, 2.85 mmol) in
toluene (20 mL). After the mixture was stirred for 20 h at 30 °C, the
solvent was eliminated under vacuum to yield a pale yellow solid which
was washed with cold pentane (20 mL). Yield: 1.20 g (80%). 31P{1H} NMR
(81 MHz, C6D6): δppm -1.9 (s). 1H NMR (300 MHz, C6D6): δppm 7.64 (d,
3JH,H = 7.8 Hz, 2H, H3,3'), 7.46-7.38 (m, 6H, H13 and H6,6'), 7.18 (m,
2H, H10), 7.10 (m, 2H, H5,5'), 7.04 (m, 3H, H4,4' and H11), 6.92-6.78 (m,
6H, H15 and H14), 5.20 (d, 2JH,P = 24.6 Hz, 1H, H1), 3.58 (sept, 3JH,H =
6.8 Hz, 2H, CH(CH3)2), 1.17 (d, 3JH,H = 6.8 Hz, 12H, CH(CH3)2). 13C{1H}
NMR (75.5 MHz, C6D6): δppm 144.6 (C8), 142.4 (d, 2JC,P = 7.4 Hz, C9),
142.2 (d, 3JC,P = 4.8 Hz, C7,7'), 140.2 (d, 3JC,P = 3.9 Hz, C2,2'), 131.9
(d, 2JC,P = 8.3 Hz, C13), 131.0 (d, 4JC,P = 2.8 Hz, C15), 128.0 (d, 1JC,P
= 91.6 Hz, C12), 127.7 (d, 3JC,P= 11.4 Hz, C13), 127.4 (d, 5JC,P = 2.0
Hz, C5,5'), 126.5 (d, 3JC,P = 1.9 Hz, C3,3'), 126.3 (d, 4JC,P = 2.3 Hz, 6
C4,4'), 122.9 (d, 4JC,P = 1.8 Hz, C10), 119.8 (d, 5JC,P = 2.9 Hz, C11),
119.6 (d, 4JC,P = 1.1 Hz, C6,6'), 53.4 (d, 1JC,P = 68.7 Hz, C1), 28.8
(CH), 23.9 (CH3). MS (EI 78 eV) m/z: 483 (M)+, 318 (M - Flu)+, 240 (M -
Flu - Ph)+, 165 (Flu)+. Mp: 186 °C. Anal. Calcd for C37H36NP: C, 84.54;
H, 6.90; N, 2.66. Found: C, 84.14; H, 7.04; N, 2.64.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM Staudinger reaction
