$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Synthesis of N-Trimethylsilyl-[tris(pyrrolidino)]phosphazene:
Trimethylsilylazide (7.55 g, 64.3 mmol, 1.5 eq.) was added dropwise to a
solution of tris(pyrrolidino)phosphane (10.34 g, 42.9 mmol, 1.0 eq.) in
50 mL of toluene. The reaction mixture was refluxed for 2 h at 120°C
until gas evolution had ceased. The solvent was removed in vacuo and
distillation of the yellow residue (160°C, 10-1 mbar).
N-trimethylsilyl-[tris(pyrrolidino)]phosphazene as a viscous colorless
oil, yield 11.40 g, 35.0 mmol, 79%. [C15H33N4PSi] (328.51 g/mol)1H-NMR
(300.1 MHz, C6D6): δ = 3.07-3.01 (m, 12H, H(1)), 1.55-1-51 (m, 12H,
H(2)), 0.43 (s, 9H, -SiMe3) ppm. 13C-NMR (75.5 MHz, C6D6): δ = 46.8 (d,
2JP-C = 4.3 Hz, C(1)), 26.7 (d, 3JP-C = 7.9 Hz, C(2)), 5.0 (d, 3JP-C =
2.7 Hz, -SiMe3) ppm. 31P-NMR (121.5 MHz, C6D6): δ = 0.7 ppm. ESI-MS
(MeCN): m/z (%) = 329 (9) [MH]+, 257 (100) [MH-SiMe3]+, 186 (18)
[MHC7H19NSi]+. ESI-HRMS: m/z [MH]+ calculated 329.2290, found 329.2284.
IR: ν (cm-1) = 2946 (m), 2863 (m), 1369 (m), 1337 (m), 1320 (m), 1235
(m), 1198 (w), 1132 (w), 1065 (s), 1001 (s), 959 (w), 912 (s), 861 (s),
745 (m), 670 (w), 596 (w), 557 (s), 444 (w).
